{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "2c3cb8ed-973f-426a-bf6b-d05208168c0e",
      "name": "Reward Addresses",
      "description": {
        "content": "Reward addresses are blockchain addresses registered for reward attribution.\n\nCustody Rewards: For EVM chains, Paxos registers these addresses on-chain for reward calculation and accrual in the token contract. For Solana, provide the **owner account** (not a token account) — Paxos will derive and register the associated token account on-chain for the given asset. Providing a token account will result in a derived address with no meaning. For other non-EVM chains, Paxos tracks on-chain activity for custody reward calculation.\n\nNon-Custody Rewards: Paxos tracks on-chain activity for these addresses to calculate and distribute non-custody rewards to your organization.\n\n*These endpoints are only relevant for whitelisted Rewards partners.*\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
